  <note class="self-check"><para>Which of the following equations can be found by adding the equations in the system of equations shown?</para>
<para>     \(\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;+\;5y\;=\;–9\\–3x\;–\;7y\;=\;–21\end{array}\right.\)</para></note>
